# ==============================================================================
# 40-auditing.list: Password Cracking & Authentication Testing
# ==============================================================================
# Instructions:
#  - To DISABLE a tool: prefix with '#' (e.g., # medusa)
#  - To REMOVE a tool:  delete the line
#  - To ADD a tool:     add the Fedora package name on a new line
# ==============================================================================

# --- Offline Password & Hash Cracking ---
john                        # John the Ripper - advanced offline password and hash cracker
hashcat                     # High-performance multi-threaded GPU-accelerated hash cracker
cowpatty                    # Offline WPA/WPA2 PSK dictionary attack tool

# --- Online Network Authentication Brute-Forcing ---
hydra                       # Very fast parallelized network login cracker (SSH, FTP, HTTP, etc.)
medusa                      # Speedy, parallel, modular login brute-forcer for remote services

# --- Dictionaries & Wordlists ---
words                       # System English dictionary wordlist (/usr/share/dict/words)
